<h2>Produksi</h2>
<h3>Pengembangan</h3>
Produksi.
Pengembangan.
Ing tanggal 5 Maret 2010, diumumake yen Paramount Pictures ngembangake adaptasi anyar saka novel Pet Sematary, Stephen King, lan Matt Greenberg wis disewakake nulis naskah. Dhèwèké mung nampa "crita layar" kredit. Tanggal 31 Oktober 2013, dilaporake yen Lorenzo di Bonaventura lan Steven Schneider bakal dadi produser kanggo prodhuksi, lan Juan Carlos Fresnadillo ana ing omongan.
Ing tanggal 30 Oktober 2017, iki diumumake yen Paramount Pictures wis resmi nampilake filem kasebut, sing diarepake bakal diarahake déning Kevin Kölsch lan Dennis Widmyer, saka layar drama déning Jeff Buhler lan David Kajganich (sing terakhir ora ditindakake). Kajaba saka Di Bonaventura lan Schneider, Mark Vahradian uga diprodhuksi.
<h3>Casting</h3>
Casting.
Ing tanggal 16 April 2018, iki diumumake yen Jason Clarke wis diluncurake ing peran utama Louis Creed. Tanggal 4 Mei 2018, dilaporake John Lithgow wis gabung ing peran judhul Crandall.
Ing sasi Juni 2018, Amy Seimetz bakal nduweni peran wadon, Rachel Creed, bebarengan karo Jeté Laurence minangka anak wadon Creed, Ellie lan kembar Hugo lan Lucas Lavoie minangka putra Creed, Gage.
Ing Oktober 2018, dilaporake Obssa Ahmed wis ditambahake minangka mahasiswa mahasiswa Pascow Victor, lan Alyssa Brooke Levine minangka Zelda Goldman. Zelda sadurunge digambar déning stuntman Andrew Hubatsek, ing filem 1989.
<h3>Penggambaran</h3>
Penggambaran.
Fotografi utama diwiwit iing tanggal 18 Juni 2018, ing Hudson, Quebec, &lt;a href="Kanadhah"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;. Film sing dibungkus tanggal 11 Agustus 2018.
<h3>Musik</h3>
Musik.
Christopher Young nyusun skor filem kasebut. Kridit pungkasan kalebu versi panutup lagu Ramones " Pet Sematary " déning Starcrawler band punk rock Amerika.
<h2>Rilis</h2>
Rilis.
Film iki wiwitané arep bakal dirilis ing April 19, 2019, nanging dipindhah rong minggu saka tanggal release asli April 19, 2019 kanggo April 5, 2019. Ing tanggal 10 Oktober, 2018, filem kang pisanan Trailer dirilis, diikuti karo foto 3D sing dikirim 1 Nopember 2018, liwat fungsi foto 3D &lt;a href="Facebook"&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;. Film iki diwiwiti ing South by Southwest tanggal 16 Maret 2019.
<h2>Resepsi</h2>
<h3>Kantor kothak</h3>
Resepsi.
Kantor kothak.
Pet Sematary mbayar $ 54.7 yuta ing Amerika Serikat lan Kanada, lan $ 57.7 yuta ing wilayah liyane, kanthi total $ 112.4 yuta, nglawan anggaran produksi $ 21 yuta.
Ing Amerika Serikat lan Kanada, Pet Sematary dirilis bareng Shazam! lan Best of Enemies, lan diajukake $ 20-30 yuta saka 2.500 bioskop ing akhir minggu. Iki nggawe $ 2,3 yuta saka papat ing wayah wengi. Iku banjur nyusul $ 10 yuta ing dina kapisan, kalebu pratinjau. Dhèwèké miwiti debut dadi $ 25 yuta, nglumpukake nomer loro, ngiwa Shazam!. Film ambruk 59% ing akhir minggu kapindho kanggo $ 10 yuta, pagawean papat, lan banjur digawé $ 4.9 yuta ing akhir minggu pihak, pagawean kapitu.
<h3>Respon kritis</h3>
Respon kritis.
Ing review Aggregator Rotten Tomatoes, filem nduweni rating persetujuan 57% adhedhasar 242 review, kanthi rating rata-rata 5.95 / 10. Kesepakatan kritis situs web kasebut, " Sematary Pet njupuk materi sumber kasebut ing sawetara arah, nanging remake iki minangka kaya ngumandhang meh saben dina minangka kebangkitan." Ing Metacritic, filem iki nduweni skor rata-rata bobot saka 57 saka 100, adhedhasar 42 pangritik, nuduhake "review campuran utawa rata-rata". Pemirsa sing diselidiki déning CinemaScore menehi filem rata-rata "C +" ing skala A + kanggo F, nalika sing ing PostTrak menehi skor positif sakabèhé 66% lan 47% "saran tartamtu".
<h2>Bisa prequel</h2>
Bisa prequel.
Ing sasi Maret 2019, produser Di Bonaventura nyatakake yen prekel kanggo filem kasebut bisa ditindakake yen filem kasebut sukses sacara finansial, "I generally don't start thinking about [sequels] until they're a success. I think if there's anything here, there's a prequel. I think if you look at the book, we didn't cover all that stuff that happens before the Creed family moves in. So, I think there's a movie there, and I think I'd be particularly interested in doing that, because, again, it's the source material and you are going toward something that also has a lot of crazy, creepy feelings about it."
In April 2019, directors Kölsch and Widmyer ruled themselves out of returning, saying, "If you were going to be more, you'd probably do backstory stuff. [...] I'd be really interested to see how somebody would do a sequel to this movie. It probably won't be us."
In May 2019, screenwriter Buhler stated that there had been preliminary discussions on a continuation, saying, "So a lot of the ideas that we've been batting around currently, recently, have all been about, more about digging into the mythology of the town, these rituals that children present, the mythology of the Micmac, the Wendigo, the cemetery, the origins, Jud's life. So it looks like, I don't want to promise anything, because we don't know, we're not even down the road on an idea yet."
