<li>SMPN 2 Cilegon (2003-2006)</li>
<li>SMA Cahaya Madani Banten Boarding School (2006-2009)</li>
<li>Jurusan Manajemen Fakultas Ekonomi Universitas Sultan Ageng Tirtayasa (Untirta) (2009-2014)</li>
</ul>
